   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wetlands 4 Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description akvo:type="4" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A ten year global wetland ambition</narrative>
  </description>
  <description akvo:type="5" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The **Wetlands for Resilience (W4R)** programme aims to scale up healthy, biodiverse, and well-managed wetland landscapes globally by 2030, contributing to climate resilience and environmentally and socially sustainable development. Phase 1 of the programme (2023&#x2013;2026) focuses on developing and applying a W4R Model Approach and Toolbox to support integrated wetland restoration and sustainable landscape management. At the landscape level, W4R supports multi-stakeholder partnerships and on-the-ground restoration and livelihood activities in the Sundarbans in Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
